WEBVTT

00:06:29.885 --> 00:06:32.596
we can leverage this momentum

00:06:32.638 --> 00:06:37.226
and expand, secure and protect

00:06:37.226 --> 00:06:41.021
up to 50 million hectares
of land and forests.

00:06:41.814 --> 00:06:43.107
And reach --

00:06:43.107 --> 00:06:46.944
(Applause)

00:06:46.944 --> 00:06:51.615
reach 50 million forest guardians
in the next five years.

00:06:51.615 --> 00:06:58.414
What we've learned is that when
in the midst of environmental destruction,

00:06:58.456 --> 00:07:00.624
conflict and criminalization,